ust thinking about it is getting Paimon all worried.","nextNodeIds":[751350205,751350207]},{"nodeId":751350205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2246722514,"text":"Don't be scared, Paimon.","nextNodeIds":[751350206]},{"nodeId":751350206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1604176258,"text":"Alright, if you say so. But don't stray too far from Paimon, you hear?","nextNodeIds":[751350209]},{"nodeId":751350209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21583,"speakerName":"Bona","textMapHash":3007403242,"text":"Anyway, so what we've gotta do now is put the Pyrophosphorite on the Altar, right? But, ah, we've got two on our hands, so... Let's put them both up there, just to be safe.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":751350207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3253839562,"text":"How exciting!","nextNodeIds":[751350208]},{"nodeId":751350208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21583,"speakerName":"Bona","textMapHash":1820221778,"text":"Right? I'm getting super excited too. No real adventurers would wanna miss out on a challenge like this!","nextNodeIds":[751350209]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7513502,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["0"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_EXIT_VEHICLE"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["[3_9742:81.144,796.510,9706.067]","25"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"}}},{"subQuestId":7513504,"order":5,"stepDescription":"Offer the 